#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0803 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: Within a dataset, there is more than one value of STUDYID for a given value of STUDYIDN, considering only those rows on which both variables are populated
# Declared-tier scope: structure= states the ADaM data structure this minimal table stands for;
# #define is its mandatory carrier (ScenarioDeclaredScopeProvider.install).
#define standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col USUBJID type=Char
col STUDYID type=Char
col STUDYIDN type=Char
---
01-701-1015 | CDISCPILOT01 | 1
01-701-1023 | CDISCPILOT02 | 2
01-701-1028 | CDISCPILOT01 | 1
